<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Stone Arch Web Design — Never Miss a Lead</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Lead Capture Systems for busy contractors, landscapers, and home service businesses. We make sure you never miss a customer while you're on a job.">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <!-- Navigation -->
    <nav class="nav" id="nav">
        <div class="container nav-inner">
            <a href="#" class="logo">
                <span class="logo-icon">◆</span>
                <span class="logo-text">Stone Arch</span>
            </a>
            <button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" onclick="toggleNav()">
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
                <span></span>
            </button>
            <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
                <li><a href="#problem">The Problem</a></li>
                <li><a href="#tiers">Pricing</a></li>
                <li><a href="#process">How It Works</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact" class="nav-cta">Get a Free Preview</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <header class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-grid">
                <div class="hero-content">
                    <span class="tag">For Contractors, Landscapers & Home Service Pros</span>
                    <h1>Never Miss a Lead While You're on a Job</h1>
                    <p class="hero-subtitle">
                        Most small businesses lose 40% of potential customers to voicemail and slow response times. 
                        We build simple lead-capture systems that answer instantly — even when you're busy.
                    </p>
                    <div class="hero-buttons">
                        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">See Your Free Preview</a>
                        <a href="#tiers" class="btn btn-secondary">View Pricing</a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hero-trust">
                        <div class="trust-stars">★★★★★</div>
                        <p class="trust-text">Trusted by contractors who'd rather work with their hands than chase leads</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="hero-visual">
                    <div class="phone-mockup">
                        <div class="phone-screen">
                            <div class="chat-bubble chat-left">
                                <div class="chat-name">New Lead</div>
                                <div class="chat-text">"Hi, I need a quote for lawn care. Are you available?"</div>
                                <div class="chat-time">9:47 AM</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="chat-bubble chat-right">
                                <div class="chat-name">Your System</div>
                                <div class="chat-text">"Hi! Thanks for reaching out. I can help with that. What size is your yard?"</div>
                                <div class="chat-time">9:47 AM</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="chat-bubble chat-right">
                                <div class="chat-text">"While you type, here's a link to book a free estimate: [Book Now]"</div>
                                <div class="chat-time">9:48 AM</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="status-badge">
                                <span class="status-dot"></span>
                                Responding 24/7
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Problem Section -->
    <section class="problem" id="problem">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-tag">The Problem</span>
                <h2>Your Best Customers Are Calling Right Now. You're Not Picking Up.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="problem-grid">
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-icon">📞</div>
                    <h3>62% of calls go to voicemail</h3>
                    <p>And 80% of those callers never leave a message. They just call the next company in the Google results.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-icon">⏱️</div>
                    <h3>5-minute response = 400% more conversions</h3>
                    <p>But you're on a roof, in a truck, or elbows-deep in a job. You can't respond in 5 minutes.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="problem-card">
                    <div class="problem-icon">💸</div>
                    <h3>You're already paying for the lead</h3>
                    <p>Google Ads, Angi, Yelp — you're spending money to get found. Then losing the customer at the finish line.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Solution / Tiers -->
    <section class="tiers" id="tiers">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-tag">Lead Capture Systems</span>
                <h2>Three Ways to Stop Losing Customers</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">No setup fees. No long-term contracts. We do everything so you don't have to.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="tiers-grid">
                <!-- Lite -->
                <div class="tier-card">
                    <div class="tier-header">
                        <h3>LCS Lite</h3>
                        <div class="tier-price">$150<span>/month</span></div>
                        <p class="tier-for">For businesses that already have a website</p>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="tier-features">
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> AI instant response to emails & form submissions</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Online booking/estimate scheduler added to your site</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Mobile optimization fixes</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Monthly lead report (how many captured, response times)</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> We handle all setup and maintenance</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Get Started</a>
                </div>
                <!-- Complete -->
                <div class="tier-card tier-popular">
                    <div class="tier-badge">Most Popular</div>
                    <div class="tier-header">
                        <h3>LCS Complete</h3>
                        <div class="tier-price">$300<span>/month</span></div>
                        <p class="tier-for">For businesses with no website (or a broken one)</p>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="tier-features">
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Everything in Lite, plus:</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Full one-page website built from scratch</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Mobile-first, SEO-ready, fast loading</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Domain setup assistance</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Hosting included</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> 48-hour turnaround to go live</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started</a>
                </div>
                <!-- Growth -->
                <div class="tier-card">
                    <div class="tier-header">
                        <h3>LCS Growth</h3>
                        <div class="tier-price">$450<span>/month</span></div>
                        <p class="tier-for">For businesses ready to dominate their local market</p>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="tier-features">
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Everything in Complete, plus:</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Multi-page site (Services, About, Gallery, Reviews)</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Google Business Profile optimization</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Review request automation</li>
                        <li><span class="check">✓</span> Priority support & monthly strategy call</li>
                    </ul>
                    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Get Started</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Process -->
    <section class="process" id="process">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <span class="section-tag">How It Works</span>
                <h2>We Handle Everything. You Handle Your Business.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="process-grid">
                <div class="process-step">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <h3>We Build Your Preview</h3>
                    <p>You tell us about your business. Within 48 hours, we send you a live preview of your lead-capture system — no commitment, no credit card.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="process-step">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <h3>You Approve, We Go Live</h3>
                    <p>Like what you see? We handle domain setup, hosting, and launch. You don't touch a single line of code.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="process-step">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <h3>Leads Start Coming In</h3>
                    <p>Your system answers instantly, 24/7. You get a text or email when someone books. We send you a monthly report.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Social Proof -->
    <section class="proof">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="proof-grid">
                <div class="proof-stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">&lt; 5 min</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Average response time</div>
                </div>
                <div class="proof-stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">24/7</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Lead capture active</div>
                </div>
                <div class="proof-stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">$0</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">Down to get started</div>
                </div>
                <div class="proof-stat">
                    <div class="stat-number">48 hrs</div>
                    <div class="stat-label">To go live</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA / Contact -->
    <section class="cta" id="contact">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="cta-box">
                <h2>See What Your Lead-Capture System Looks Like</h2>
                <p>We'll build you a free, live preview in 48 hours. No credit card. No commitment. If you don't like it, you owe us nothing.</p>
                <form class="cta-form" onsubmit="handleSubmit(event)">
                    <input type="text" placeholder="Your business name" required>
                    <input type="tel" placeholder="Phone number" required>
                    <input type="email" placeholder="Email address" required>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Get My Free Preview</button>
                </form>
                <p class="cta-fine">Or call/text us directly: <a href="tel:+16125550199">(612) 555-0199</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="footer">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="footer-grid">
                <div class="footer-brand">
                    <a href="#" class="logo">
                        <span class="logo-icon">◆</span>
                        <span class="logo-text">Stone Arch</span>
                    </a>
                    <p>Lead Capture Systems for busy contractors, landscapers, and home service businesses.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <h4>Product</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#tiers">LCS Lite</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#tiers">LCS Complete</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#tiers">LCS Growth</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-links">
                    <h4>Company</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="#process">How It Works</a></li>
                        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="footer-contact">
                    <h4>Contact</h4>
                    <p><a href="mailto:hello@stonearchwebdesign.com">hello@stonearchwebdesign.com</a></p>
                    <p><a href="tel:+16125550199">(612) 555-0199</a></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-bottom">
                <p>© 2026 Stone Arch Web Design. Built for people who build things.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
